@startuml
title VPC-D01 Generic Connector Context
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Payment channel /\nterminal / operator flow" as Channel
component "Central PMS\nplatform control authority" as Central
component "Vendor PMS connector\nintegration boundary" as Connector
component "Vendor PMS / HCP\nraw session + normal tariff authority" as Vendor
component "Payment Orchestrator\nprovider interaction" as Pay
component "Resolved Site POS Server\nSales Invoice authority" as POS
component "Operator Console\noperations visibility" as OC
component "Management Dashboard\noperational reporting" as MDR
component "Continuity workflow\napproved degraded controls" as Cont
component "Audit / Event /\nReconciliation" as Audit
component "Gate / exit system\nconsumes Central PMS authorization" as Gate

Channel --> Central : lookup / payment flow request
Central --> Connector : live resolve / fee / projection request
Connector --> Vendor : vendor API interaction
Vendor --> Connector : vendor facts / outcomes
Connector --> Central : normalized facts + health
Central --> Pay : payment provider workflow
Central --> POS : fiscal issuance request
POS --> Central : Sales Invoice status
Central --> Gate : ExitAuthorization when eligible
Connector --> OC : health + freshness via approved backend
Connector --> MDR : operational visibility via approved backend
Connector --> Cont : freshness evidence via Central PMS
Connector --> Audit : vendor facts / health / outcomes

note bottom
Connector is an integration boundary only.
Central PMS owns payment finality and ExitAuthorization.
POS Server owns fiscal issuance.
Projection is operational visibility only.
end note
@enduml
